	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## Alfred Translate to Notion

Translates text using Google Translate and automatically saves translations to a Notion database.

### Setup

1. Install dependencies: `yarn install`
2. Configure your Notion integration:
   - Create a Notion integration at https://www.notion.so/my-integrations
   - Create a database with `Word` (Title) and `Status` (Status) properties
   - Share the database with your integration
   - Enter your credentials in the workflow configuration below

### Usage

- Keyword: `tr [word or sentence]`
- Hotkey: ⌃T (configurable)

For more details, visit: https://github.com/alejots/alfred-google-translate</string>
